---
import BlogPost from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';

const props = {
	title: 'About',
	description: 'About Erik Van Till - platform engineer, AI/LLM security researcher.',
	pubDate: new Date('2026-09-18T12:00:00Z'),
};
---

<BlogPost {...props}>
	<div>
		<p>
			I'm Erik Van Till - platform and infrastructure engineer (Apple,
			ex-Cisco security, Brivo) working on AI/LLM security research in the
			open. Day job is data platform infrastructure; the research side is
			independent vulnerability reproduction, prompt-injection and agent
			security, and tooling that hunts exposed secrets in public data.
		</p>
		<p>
			Detect-and-disclose only. Everything here runs in local labs against
			local instances, and findings are coordinated with the affected
			vendors before publication. Repo-first: code and writeups land on
			GitHub, essays land here.
		</p>
	</div>
</BlogPost>
